sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor D as Desi
  participant K as /keystatic (admin UI)
  participant GH as GitHub repo
  participant CI as GitHub Actions
  participant V as Vercel
  D->>K: Sign in with GitHub
  D->>K: Create / edit project (form + images + body)
  K->>GH: Commit to branch content/<slug>
  GH->>CI: Lint, typecheck, build, content gate, e2e
  GH->>V: Preview deployment
  V-->>D: Preview URL
  D->>GH: Merge to main
  GH->>V: Production deployment
